  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who hold Islamophobic views or who are exposed to and may be influenced by extremist narratives that associate Muslims with terrorism. The target audience likely includes those who consume and share content that normalizes or trivializes violence against Muslims, particularly those who may be sympathetic to or unaware of the dangerous stereotypes perpetuated by the meme. The casual, celebratory visual context is used to contrast with the violent text, potentially appealing to an audience that finds dark humor in or is desensitized to acts of religious persecution. The meme’s intent is to incite hatred and fear toward Muslims, so its target audience is specifically those who are predisposed to or receptive to Islamophobic rhetoric.",
